note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/apish.om: the Omega port of CUDApp tests/api_shells_diff.c for the units apishp
note (gpu/nvidia/om/api/apish_shp.om), apishk (apish_pack.om), apishl (apish_slot.om), apishr (apish_trit.om) and,
note where the test reaches them through the C shells, arnan, arscale and arslot. The test compared each Omega
note answer with the pending C under a label; this part runs the test's loops, value tables and xorshift stream and
note gives every answer to its label (as3, asi, as6 of apish-lib.om, which is composed after it), and the table
note holds, per label, the count and the digest of the pending C's answers. xp and xk are the C header's apish_p and
note apish_k: the op numbers and argument orders below are those of src/omega_api_shells.h, and as3, asi and as6
note are its casts (uint32_t, int, none). A pair result is its low and high halves.
note Not here, because their units have their own head: block and block0 (apish-blk.om), xf32 (apish-fp8x.om),
note xbf16 (apish-fp8xb.om).
